    <bpmn:process id="W_W3561" name="W3561. Project Benefits Realization Tracking &amp; Validation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Business case (W3551); post-go-live; quarterly cycle
Frequency: Quarterly + post-implementation
Volume: All completed/in-flight projects
Owner: PMO / FP&amp;A
Participants: PMO, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4/VS-33.2), Sponsor, Business Owner, BI (links to VS-28.1), Strategy (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W3561 — Project Benefits Realization Tracking &amp; Validation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3561_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3561_Lane1" name="PMO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3561_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3561_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3561_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3561_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3561_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3561_Start3" name="Business case (W3551); post-go-live; quarterly cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3561_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3561_Task4" name="PMO/Sponsor define the benefits plan per project: benefit types (financial —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PMO/Sponsor define the benefits plan per project: benefit types (financial — revenue/cost/cash; non-financial — customer/NPS links to VS-13, operational, regulatory, ESG links to VS-25), baselines, targets, measurement method, owner, and realization timeline; align to the business case (W3551)
Responsible (R): PMO / Sponsor / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3561_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3561_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3561_Task5" name="PMO/FP&amp;A track and validate benefits realization post-go-live: measure actual…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PMO/FP&amp;A track and validate benefits realization post-go-live: measure actual vs target (links to domain analytics, e.g., store sales lift links to VS-109/W3491, capex ROI links to VS-40/W2748, ESG links to VS-108/W3468), validate attribution, and identify shortfalls/root-cause
Responsible (R): PMO / FP&amp;A / Business Owner
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3561_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3561_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3561_Task6" name="PMO/Strategy report benefits realization at portfolio level to executives…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PMO/Strategy report benefits realization at portfolio level to executives (links to VS-33.2) and governance (W3552), manage shortfalls (corrective action, re-baseline), and feed outcomes to portfolio prioritization (W3547) and lessons (W3560)
Responsible (R): PMO / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3561_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3561_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3561_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3561_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3561_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-567 (ensure controlled execution — Project Benefits Realization, PMIS &amp; PMO Analytics (PA-112.3).) | - operational: disciplined baselines and validation; operational: control-group/methodology
Owner: PMO / FP&amp;A</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3561_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3561_Annotation8" targetRef="W3561_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3561_Flow10" sourceRef="W3561_Start3" targetRef="W3561_Task4" />
