    <bpmn:process id="W_W3562" name="W3562. Project Management Information System (PMIS) &amp; Tooling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PMO setup; tooling need/refresh
Frequency: Setup + maintained
Volume: Enterprise PMIS
Owner: PMO / IT
Participants: PMO, IT (links to VS-27/VS-99), BI (links to VS-28), Master Data (links to VS-29), Finance (links to VS-40), Vendors
Source: workflow W3562 — Project Management Information System (PMIS) &amp; Tooling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3562_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3562_Lane1" name="PMO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3562_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3562_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3562_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3562_Lane2" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3562_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3562_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3562_Start4" name="PMO setup; tooling need/refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3562_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3562_Task5" name="PMO/IT define the PMIS requirements: portfolio/project/program register…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PMO/IT define the PMIS requirements: portfolio/project/program register, WBS/scheduling, resource/capacity, budget/cost (integrate to capex links to VS-40), risk/issue/change, documents, dashboards/reporting, and integration to ERP/BI (links to VS-28/VS-17); select/configure the tool
Responsible (R): PMO / IT
Accountable (A): PMO Director / CIO
Duration: Setup + refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3562_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3562_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3562_Task6" name="IT/PMO implement and integrate the PMIS: configure, integrate to ERP/capex…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/PMO implement and integrate the PMIS: configure, integrate to ERP/capex (links to VS-40/W1811), HR (links to VS-19), finance (links to VS-17), and BI (links to VS-28); manage access/roles, security (links to VS-27.3), and data quality (links to VS-28.2)
Responsible (R): IT / PMO
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3562_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3562_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3562_Task7" name="PMO/IT maintain the PMIS: support/training (links to VS-19.4), user adoption…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PMO/IT maintain the PMIS: support/training (links to VS-19.4), user adoption, enhancements, and the tool lifecycle (links to VS-99); report PMIS health/adoption to PMO governance (W3552) and maturity (W3565)
Responsible (R): PMO / IT
Accountable (A): PMO Director / CIO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3562_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3562_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3562_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3562_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3562_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-567 (ensure controlled execution — Project Benefits Realization, PMIS &amp; PMO Analytics (PA-112.3).) | - operational: training, integration, and mandate
Owner: PMO / IT</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3562_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3562_Annotation9" targetRef="W3562_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
