    <bpmn:process id="W_W3563" name="W3563. Project Portfolio Performance &amp; KPI Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly analytics; PMIS data (W3562)
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Enterprise portfolio
Owner: PMO / BI
Participants: PMO, BI (links to VS-28.1), Strategy (links to VS-33.2), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Executive Committee
Source: workflow W3563 — Project Portfolio Performance &amp; KPI Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3563_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3563_Lane1" name="PMO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3563_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3563_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3563_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3563_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3563_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3563_Start3" name="Monthly analytics; PMIS data (W3562)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3563_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3563_Task4" name="PMO/BI compute portfolio KPIs: on-time/on-budget %, schedule/cost performance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PMO/BI compute portfolio KPIs: on-time/on-budget %, schedule/cost performance index (SPI/CPI), stage-gate compliance (W3548), benefits realization (W3561), resource utilization (W3553), risk/issue counts (W3558), and portfolio throughput/cycle-time; benchmark vs targets and industry
Responsible (R): PMO / BI
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3563_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3563_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3563_Task5" name="PMO/Strategy analyze portfolio trends and root causes: chronic slippage/overrun…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PMO/Strategy analyze portfolio trends and root causes: chronic slippage/overrun categories, resource bottlenecks, methodology gaps, and at-risk projects/programs; recommend portfolio/corrective actions
Responsible (R): PMO / Strategy
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3563_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3563_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3563_Task6" name="PMO publish the portfolio performance analytics to executives (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PMO publish the portfolio performance analytics to executives (links to VS-33.2) and governance (W3552), drive data-informed decisions, and feed insights to maturity/CI (W3565) and methodology (W3548)
Responsible (R): PMO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Monthly/quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3563_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3563_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3563_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3563_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3563_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-567 (ensure controlled execution — Project Benefits Realization, PMIS &amp; PMO Analytics (PA-112.3).) | - operational: data governance (links to VS-28); operational: balanced KPIs and audit
Owner: PMO / BI</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
