    <bpmn:process id="W_W3564" name="W3564. Program / Project Financial Performance vs Business Case" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project closure (W3560); quarterly finance cycle
Frequency: Per project + quarterly
Volume: All projects/programs
Owner: Finance / PMO
Participants: Finance (links to VS-40/VS-17.4), PMO, FP&amp;A, Sponsor, Audit (links to VS-21), Treasury (links to VS-18)
Source: workflow W3564 — Program / Project Financial Performance vs Business Case</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3564_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3564_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3564_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3564_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3564_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3564_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3564_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3564_Start3" name="Project closure (W3560); quarterly finance cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3564_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3564_Task4" name="Finance/PMO reconcile project/program financial performance vs the approved…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance/PMO reconcile project/program financial performance vs the approved business case (W3551): actual cost vs budget (links to VS-40/W1825), actual capex vs CIP/asset turnover (links to VS-40/W1828), cash/timing (links to VS-18), and financial benefits realized (W3561); compute payback/IRR vs plan
Responsible (R): Finance / PMO / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per project/quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3564_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3564_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3564_Task5" name="Finance/PMO identify financial performance drivers (estimate accuracy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/PMO identify financial performance drivers (estimate accuracy, change-orders W3556, scope/schedule, market), manage write-offs for abandoned/under-performing projects (links to VS-40/W2750), and ensure proper capitalization (links to VS-40/W1823)
Responsible (R): Finance / PMO
Accountable (A): CFO
