    <bpmn:process id="W_W3568" name="W3568. Enterprise Transformation &amp; Change Management Portfolio" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategic transformation (links to VS-33); change-intake
Frequency: Program + ongoing
Volume: Transformation/change portfolio
Owner: PMO / Transformation / Change
Participants: PMO, Transformation/Innovation (links to VS-30), Change Mgmt, HR/EX (links to VS-103.2), Strategy (links to VS-33), Communications (links to VS-14.3), Executive Committee
Source: workflow W3568 — Enterprise Transformation &amp; Change Management Portfolio</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3568_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3568_Lane1" name="PMO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3568_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3568_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3568_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3568_Lane2" name="Change Mgmt">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3568_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3568_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3568_Start4" name="Strategic transformation (links to VS-33); change-intake">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3568_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3568_Task5" name="PMO/Transformation govern the enterprise transformation portfolio: strategic…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PMO/Transformation govern the enterprise transformation portfolio: strategic transformations (e.g., digital/ERP links to VS-27/VS-30, omnichannel links to VS-60, net-zero links to VS-25/VS-108, operating-model change), structure as programs (W3549), and align to corporate strategy (links to VS-33); integrate change-management (links to VS-103.2)
Responsible (R): PMO / Transformation / Strategy
Accountable (A): CEO / COO
Duration: Program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3568_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3568_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3568_Task6" name="Change Mgmt/PMO manage organizational change across the portfolio: stakeholder…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Change Mgmt/PMO manage organizational change across the portfolio: stakeholder engagement (W3559), communication (links to VS-14.3/VS-103.2), training/adoption (links to VS-19.4), resistance management, and business readiness; coordinate change across concurrent projects/programs to avoid change-fatigue
Responsible (R): Change Mgmt / PMO / HR
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3568_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3568_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3568_Task7" name="PMO/Transformation track transformation outcomes and adoption (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PMO/Transformation track transformation outcomes and adoption (links to VS-103/W3561), report to executives (links to VS-33.2) and Board (links to VS-36), and feed learnings to maturity (W3565) and strategy (links to VS-33); manage the transformation portfolio within the overall project portfolio (W3545)
Responsible (R): PMO / Transformation
Accountable (A): CEO / COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3568_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3568_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3568_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3568_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3568_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-567 (ensure controlled execution — Project Benefits Realization, PMIS &amp; PMO Analytics (PA-112.3).) | - operational: portfolio sequencing and change-load management; operational: change-management and adoption tracking
Owner: PMO / Transformation / Change</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
